1
00:00:00,206 --> 00:00:04,836
(Stuart:)I, um-- I want you to know that
even though we're on opposite sides...

2
00:00:05,002 --> 00:00:06,832
(Stuart:)...I bear you no ill will.

3
00:00:08,047 --> 00:00:10,677
(Penny:)-Thank you, Stuart. It's nice to know.
-Mm-hm.

4
00:00:10,883 --> 00:00:13,843
(Stuart:)People from opposite sides
often have good relationships.

5
00:00:14,053 --> 00:00:15,593
(Stuart:)You know, Romeo and Juliet...

6
00:00:15,805 --> 00:00:19,145
(Stuart:)...Tony and Maria from West Side Story.

7
00:00:19,725 --> 00:00:22,895
(Stuart:)What's-his-name
and the big, blue chick in Avatar.

8
00:00:25,398 --> 00:00:27,398
(Stuart:)I'm gonna bowl now.

9
00:00:29,819 --> 00:00:31,279
(Sheldon:)Be the ball, Howard.

10
00:00:31,821 --> 00:00:33,701
(Howard:)Leave me alone, Sheldon.

11
00:00:42,373 --> 00:00:43,753
(Sheldon:)You weren't the ball.

12
00:00:46,877 --> 00:00:48,457
(Penny:)Hey, thanks.

13
00:00:48,629 --> 00:00:50,379
(Leonard:)-This is fun, huh?
-Yeah.

14
00:00:50,548 --> 00:00:52,378
It's good we got out
and did something physical.

15
00:00:52,591 --> 00:00:55,051
(Penny:)-Mm-hm.
-Gets us out of our heads.

16
00:00:55,219 --> 00:00:56,259
(Leonard:)You get in your head...

17
00:00:56,429 --> 00:00:59,429
(Leonard:)...you start to over-think, over-analyze,
obsess, you worry.

